From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: abhay-byte <abhay02delhi@gmail.com>
Date: Sun, 4 Oct 2026 12:00:00 +0530
Subject: [PATCH] panvk: report the PanVK-kbase release in driverInfo

Expose the PanVK-kbase release in driverInfo so DXVK HUD and PanProbe
show the release name (RC3) alongside the Mesa version. Allow build-time
overrides with PANVK_KBASE_RELEASE; the resulting string fits the 256-byte
driverInfo.

Purpose: show the PanVK-kbase release in DXVK HUD / PanProbe
Tested GPU: not run (target: Mali-G615 MC6 / Poco X6 Pro)
Tested Kbase UAPI: not run (target: CSF 1.21 / MediaTek)
Mesa base range: 5a07217f034b (26.3.0-devel), patched through csf-v11/098
Validation test: patch -p1 --dry-run against the current patched Mesa source

Generated-by: LLM
---

diff --git a/src/panfrost/vulkan/panvk_vX_physical_device.c b/src/panfrost/vulkan/panvk_vX_physical_device.c
index 90ed3daa229..9eb316fa1b6 100644
--- a/src/panfrost/vulkan/panvk_vX_physical_device.c
+++ b/src/panfrost/vulkan/panvk_vX_physical_device.c
@@ -28,6 +28,10 @@
 #include "pan_format.h"
 #include "pan_props.h"
 
+#ifndef PANVK_KBASE_RELEASE
+#define PANVK_KBASE_RELEASE "RC3"
+#endif
+
 /* We reserve one ubo for push constant, one for sysvals and one per-set for the
  * descriptor metadata  */
 #define RESERVED_UBO_COUNT                   6
@@ -1374,7 +1378,8 @@
 
    snprintf(properties->driverName, VK_MAX_DRIVER_NAME_SIZE, "panvk");
    snprintf(properties->driverInfo, VK_MAX_DRIVER_INFO_SIZE,
-            "Mesa " PACKAGE_VERSION MESA_GIT_SHA1);
+            "PanVK-kbase " PANVK_KBASE_RELEASE " (Mesa " PACKAGE_VERSION
+            MESA_GIT_SHA1 ")");
 
    /* VK_EXT_physical_device_drm */
    if (device->drm.primary_rdev) {
--
